        <mxCell id="02-v23" value="&lt;b&gt;A: TRACK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agent=TRACKING&lt;br&gt;Detector tracking on" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#b45309;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontStyle=0;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="02-1">
